[45.8943, "o", "╭──┬────────────┬───────┬──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮\r\n│\u001b[1m#\u001b[0m\u001b[1m \u001b[0m│\u001b[1m \u001b[0m\u001b[1mFocus     \u001b[0m\u001b[1m \u001b[0m│\u001b[1m \u001b[0m\u001b[1mScore\u001b[0m\u001b[1m \u001b[0m│\u001b[1m \u001b[0m\u001b[1mFeedback                                                             \u001b[0m│\r\n├──┼────────────┼───────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\r\n│1 │ behaviour  │ \u001b[1;32m20/20\u001b[0m │ Correct: the second call returns the existing refund id without      │\r\n│  │            │       │ touching the gateway again.                                          │\r\n│2 │ motivation │ \u001b[1;33m12/20\u001b[0m │ Partly: it also avoids a network call and never returns an id for an │\r\n│  │            │       │ invalid request.                                                     │\r\n│3 │ edge case  │ \u001b[1;32m20/20\u001b[0m │ Exactly: without a key the retry refunds again, so idempotency is    │\r\n│  │            │       │ opt-in.                                                              │\r\n│4 │ risk       │ \u001b[1;32m20/20\u001b[0m │ Correct: find_refund is new and its errors now surface from refund() │\r\n│  │            │       │ before any money moves.                                              │\r\n│5 │ testing    │ \u001b[1;32m20/20\u001b[0m │ Good: a fake gateway that records calls lets you assert one refund   │\r\n│  │            │       │ and the same id twice.                                               │\r\n╰──┴────────────┴───────┴──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\r\n"]
[45.8948, "o", "╭────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮\r\n│ \u001b[1;32mGrip Score: 92/100\u001b[0m  \u001b[1;32mPASS\u001b[0m \u001b[2m(pass mark 70)\u001b[0m                                    │\r\n│                                                                            │\r\n│ Solid grasp of the change, its motivation and its new dependency. Ship it. │\r\n╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\r\n"]
